#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:28
msgid ""
"You should configure email for notifications to be notified about router "
"events"
msgstr ""
"Aby ste boli informovaní o prevádzke routera, mali by ste nastaviť e-mail "
"pre notifikácie"

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:31
msgid ""
"Turris system contains notification system. Various components, including"
" healthcheck, are using it to inform administrator about possible issues."
msgstr ""
"Súčasťou systému Turris je systém notifikácií. Jeho rozličné komponenty, "
"vrátane kontroly stavu, ho používajú na informovanie administrátora o "
"možných problémoch."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:35
msgid ""
"In Foris navigate to Maintenance setting and configure email "
"notifications there."
msgstr ""
"V rozhraní Foris prejdite do nastavení údržby a nastavte tam e-mailové "
"oznámenia."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:46
msgid "Email notifications seems to be configured."
msgstr "Zdá sa, že e-mailové oznámenia sú nastavené."

#: healthcheck_setup/email_notifications.py:49
msgid "Notifications are send to following mail addresses: "
msgstr "Notifikácie sa posielajú na nasledujúce e-mailové adresy: "

#: healthcheck_setup/__init__.py:19
msgid "Suggestion for router setup."
msgstr "Návrh na nastavenie routera."
